  "Id": 2449,
  "Title": "AKU-ISMC 2020-2021 Publications Catalogue Now Online",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Details of new and upcoming publications",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass73D33C6459D7462D8816E922A364BF81\"><p><br></p><p>We are delighted to announce that our new publications catalogue is now <a href=\"/ismc/publications/Documents/AKU%20Publications%20Catalogue%202020-21%20v5.pdf\">online\u200b</a>,&#160;containing details of all of our new, forthcoming and current&#160;publications. Upcoming publications in 2021&#160;include&#160;<em>Human Rights</em> and <em>Reformist Islam&#160;and&#160;Blasphemy and Apostasy in Islam&#58; Debates on Shi'a&#160;Jurisprudence</em>, both by Mohsen Kadivar. The catalogue also contains information on&#160;the Institute's<em> Abdou Filali-Ansary&#160;Occasional Paper&#160;Series </em>and forthcoming journal; <em>Journal of Material Cultures in the Muslim World</em>.&#160;<br></p><p>The Institute's&#160;publications&#160;address&#160;current trends of thought about Islam, Muslims and Muslim societies. By creating access to scholarship from Muslim contexts in the English language and on a global platform, our publications foster intellectual exchange and dialogue about and between Muslim societies and cultures.</p><p><br></p></div>",
